                {
                    "text": "1 Example Road\nSampletown SA1 OXX\nTel. 0000 000 0000\nhelp@northwind.example",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.7599758,
                        "top": 0.067122705,
                        "right": 0.90810156,
                        "bottom": 0.113723814
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.8532001,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Our records show that your gas and electricity account is currently overdue. As of 26 September\n2026 the overdue balance on your account is £142.80. This amount relates to the billing periods\nJune to August 2026 and has not yet been settled.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.10157195,
                        "top": 0.34758443,
                        "right": 0.87605804,
                        "bottom": 0.40401882
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.896582,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "We would like to help you resolve this without further reminders or additional charges. If you\nbelieve the balance is incorrect, or if you have already paid it, please let us know. We ask that you\nreply to this letter by 10 October 2026, either by telephone, by e-mail or by returning the reply slip\nenclosed with this letter.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.100362755,
                        "top": 0.41128686,
                        "right": 0.88875455,
                        "bottom": 0.48439503
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.8879775,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "If we do not hear from you by that date we may have to pass your account to our collections team.\nWe would much rather avoid this, and so we have set out a proposal on the last page of this letter\nwhich spreads the cost over a longer period.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.09854897,
                        "top": 0.49337325,
                        "right": 0.88512695,
                        "bottom": 0.5498076
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.89593816,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Please note that the terms and conditions of the payment arrangement are printed overleaf on\npage 2 and form part of this letter.",
