                },
                {
                    "text": "Terms and conditions of payment arrangements",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.09431681,
                        "top": 0.10089782,
                        "right": 0.56227326,
                        "bottom": 0.11586148
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.90434694,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "1. Scope. These terms apply to every payment arrangement offered by Northwind Utilities Ltd. (the\nSupplier) to a domestic customer (the Customer) in respect of an overdue account balance. They\ndo not affect any statutory rights of the Customer.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.0949214,
                        "top": 0.12270201,
                        "right": 0.8857316,
                        "bottom": 0.17870885
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.8946694,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "2. Agreement. A payment arrangement becomes binding when the Customer confirms it in writing,\nby telephone or by e-mail, or when the first instalment is collected. The Supplier may withdraw an\noffer that has not been accepted within the period stated in the letter.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.095525995,
                        "top": 0.18298419,
                        "right": 0.8814994,
                        "bottom": 0.23728089
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.89291435,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "3. Instalments. Instalments are due on the dates shown in the arrangement. If the amount of an\ninstalment is changed following a review of the Customer's consumption, the Supplier will inform\nthe Customer in writing at least thirty days before the change takes effect.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.096130595,
                        "top": 0.24369389,
                        "right": 0.8712213,
                        "bottom": 0.2979906
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.89577806,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "4. Direct debit. Where the arrangement is paid by direct debit, the Customer will receive advance\nnotice of the amount and the collection date. The Customer is protected by the Direct Debit\nGuarantee and may cancel the mandate at any time through their bank or building society.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.09673519,
                        "top": 0.303121,
                        "right": 0.8754535,
                        "bottom": 0.35784525
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.90207976,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "5. Missed payments. If a payment is missed the Supplier will contact the Customer to agree a new\ndate. Repeated missed payments may result in the arrangement being cancelled and the full\noutstanding balance becoming due immediately.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.09794438,
                        "top": 0.36297563,
                        "right": 0.88633615,
                        "bottom": 0.41812742
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.8970777,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "6. Charges. No additional charge is made for entering into a payment arrangement. Any charge for\na returned payment will be limited to the actual cost incurred by the Supplier and will be notified in\nadvance.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.09915357,
                        "top": 0.42240274,
                        "right": 0.8917775,
                        "bottom": 0.47541684
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.89441985,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "7. Complaints. If the Customer is unhappy with any aspect of the arrangement, they may contact\nthe Supplier's complaints team. If the complaint is not resolved within eight weeks the Customer\nmay refer it to the relevant ombudsman service free of charge.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.100362755,
                        "top": 0.48225737,
                        "right": 0.87484884,
                        "bottom": 0.5365541
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.8985482,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "8. Data prote ction. Personal data supplied in connection with a payment arrangement is processed\nonly to administer the account, in accordance with the Supplier's privacy notice which is available\non request.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.100967355,
                        "top": 0.5391193,
                        "right": 0.8960097,
                        "bottom": 0.5972638
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.8743585,
                    "language": "und"
                },
                {
                    "text": "9. Changes. The Supplier may amend these terms where required by law or by a change in\nregulation. Customers will be informed of any amendment that affects an existing arrangement.\n10. Governing law. These terms are governed by the law of England and VWales and are subject to\nthe jurisdiction of its courts.",
                    "bounds": {
                        "left": 0.100967355,
                        "top": 0.6028217,
                        "right": 0.8917775,
                        "bottom": 0.6814878
                    },
                    "confidence": 0.8865979,
                    "language": "und"
